Package: dCAM
Type: Package
Title: Detecting cell type specific differential expressions in grouped bulk data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Saurabh", "Bhardwaj ", email = "dpdu@vt.edu", role = c("aut")),
             person("Yizhi", "Wang", email = "yzwang@vt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
biocViews: Software, CellBiology, GeneExpression
Description: We present reference-free differential Convex Analysis of Mixtures (dCAM), 
  a joint deconvolution method of analyzing grouped bulk data of varying composition 
  that can improve detection of cell type specific differential expressions in many 
  biological contexts. With an L1-norm differential expression penalty-based
  regularization, dCAM jointly and iteratively estimates both cell type
  proportions and cell type specific gene expressions in grouped bulk data, 
  and performs cell type-specific differential expression analysis between groups.
